          "description": "PSYCHIC. Select two friendly CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED operatives visible to and within 5\" of this operative. Remove them both from the killzone and set them back up in each other's previous locations (in other words, swap their positions). If one of them performed the Charge, Fall Back or Reposition action during this turning point and the other is ready, the other cannot perform any of those actions in its activation during this turning point. This operative cannot perform this action while within control range of an enemy operative."
